    {
      "id": "t152",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950.6666666666666,
      "y": 735,
      "width": 773.5,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 724268577,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 259552007,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00151",
      "text": "• warmup_data: warmup_bars real bars strictly BEFORE train_start. Past only. They seed the rolling features and the\nEWMA covariance, so the first train bar already has a feature row. They are never training rows.",
      "originalText": "• warmup_data: warmup_bars real bars strictly BEFORE train_start. Past only. They seed the rolling features and the\nEWMA covariance, so the first train bar already has a feature row. They are never training rows.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "t153",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950.6666666666666,
      "y": 781.5,
      "width": 764.75,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1531925707,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 996073679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00152",
      "text": "• train_data_with_warmup = warmup + train. The train-side features are built from this slice only, so they cannot see\nthe forecast period.",
      "originalText": "• train_data_with_warmup = warmup + train. The train-side features are built from this slice only, so they cannot see\nthe forecast period.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "t154",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950.6666666666666,
      "y": 828,
      "width": 764.75,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1704062676,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1056792748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00153",
      "text": "• DANGEROUS_merged_warmedup_FORECAST_data = warmup + train + forecast. The forecast-side features are\nbuilt from this, because the forecast days need the history behind them.",
      "originalText": "• DANGEROUS_merged_warmedup_FORECAST_data = warmup + train + forecast. The forecast-side features are\nbuilt from this, because the forecast days need the history behind them.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "t155",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950.6666666666666,
      "y": 874.5,
      "width": 763,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2086300331,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 200715763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00154",
      "text": "• Own-day rule: the features of day t predict the return of day t+1. The last train feature is t9 with y = return of t10 (=\ntrain_end).",
      "originalText": "• Own-day rule: the features of day t predict the return of day t+1. The last train feature is t9 with y = return of t10 (=\ntrain_end).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "t156",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950.6666666666666,
      "y": 921,
      "width": 700.25,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 310025820,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 53356161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00155",
      "text": "• The feature of t10 has no y yet (X_out_sample_last_index). Its prediction is the first forecast, for day t11.",
      "originalText": "• The feature of t10 has no y yet (X_out_sample_last_index). Its prediction is the first forecast, for day t11.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
