      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "a00200",
      "text": "The standardized residual is (return - mu_hat) / sigma. mu_hat and sigma of a day come only from earlier days. The\nVaR reading (var_confidence, window_size, min_periods) is applied afterwards, so one filled bank can be read many\nways without retraining.",
      "originalText": "The standardized residual is (return - mu_hat) / sigma. mu_hat and sigma of a day come only from earlier days. The\nVaR reading (var_confidence, window_size, min_periods) is applied afterwards, so one filled bank can be read many\nways without retraining.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
